{
  "message": "The closest precedent is recipe detail’s existing Print/Export/Edit action row plus DLC 08’s print contract. That pattern works for the new export entry point and status/errors, but the currently shared browser page is an offline cached view with unstyled HTML, so it isn’t valid visual evidence for toolbar geometry. The requested delta is adding HTML, PNG, and generated PDF alongside the existing ZIP export.\n\nThe current DLC 09 brief explicitly leaves export runtime, fidelity, and scale unresolved. Please review these proposed decisions before I update the brief and begin implementation. My recommended defaults are browser-side file generation (avoids private server artifacts), a static snapshot of the active reader presentation and scale/unit state, inline instruction photos embedded for offline use while omitting gallery photos per DLC 08, and an accessible format menu on the existing Export action with ZIP retained as an option.",
  "requestedSchema": {
    "properties": {
      "generation": {
        "type": "string",
        "title": "Where should files be generated?",
        "description": "Browser-side avoids server rendering/storage artifacts; server-side may handle larger output but needs a trusted renderer and private cleanup boundary.",
        "oneOf": [
          {
            "const": "browser",
            "title": "Browser-side (recommended)"
          },
          {
            "const": "server",
            "title": "Trusted server-side renderer"
          }
        ],
        "default": "browser"
      },
      "presentation": {
        "type": "string",
        "title": "Which recipe state should exports capture?",
        "description": "Static, point-in-time file output; reader controls and stored recipe data remain unchanged.",
        "oneOf": [
          {
            "const": "active",
            "title": "Current reader state: scale, units, and presentation (recommended)"
          },
          {
            "const": "canonical",
            "title": "Canonical stored recipe values, unscaled"
          }
        ],
        "default": "active"
      },
      "photos": {
        "type": "string",
        "title": "Which recipe photos should be included?",
        "description": "DLC 08 omits gallery photos in print and includes inline instruction photos by default. HTML must work offline.",
        "oneOf": [
          {
            "const": "instructions",
            "title": "Embed inline instruction photos; omit gallery photos (recommended)"
          },
          {
            "const": "all",
            "title": "Embed gallery and inline instruction photos"
          }
        ],
        "default": "instructions"
      },
      "entry_point": {
        "type": "string",
        "title": "How should formats be selected?",
        "description": "There is currently one Export recipe action that immediately starts a ZIP download.",
        "oneOf": [
          {
            "const": "menu",
            "title": "Accessible format menu: ZIP, HTML, PNG, PDF (recommended)"
          },
          {
            "const": "separate",
            "title": "Keep ZIP immediate and add a separate formats action"
          }
        ],
        "default": "menu"
      }
    }
  }
}

